# Normalise line endings. The repo stores LF; Windows checkouts get CRLF
# via core.autocrlf=true. Added 2026-08-04 after the working tree drifted
# to CRLF and produced a 38,829-line phantom diff across 49 files.
* text=auto

# Explicitly binary so git never tries to normalise them.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf  binary
*.ico  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
